        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this third person action adventure inspired by classic survival horror games, you will play the role of an FBI agent and travel to a secret research base that has been sealed off for many years to investigate the source of the virus. Abandoned corridors, dilapidated laboratories, residual surveillance footage, and scattered bloodstains pieced together a tragedy deliberately covered up. As exploration deepens, you will discover that this place has never truly been 'abandoned'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>The thrilling survival battle</strong></u>: With limited ammunition and resources, every shot must be carefully considered before taking action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762110/extras/4e5a2c646c6cdba26dbed85c6f676c3d.poster.avif?t=1762452501\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762110/extras/4e5a2c646c6cdba26dbed85c6f676c3d.webm?t=1762452501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762110/extras/4e5a2c646c6cdba26dbed85c6f676c3d.mp4?t=1762452501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Immersive horror atmosphere</strong></u>: Realistic art style and sound design make people step by step shocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762110/extras/01e0a39958e162db0208990ca37b3b24.poster.avif?t=1762452501\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762110/extras/01e0a39958e162db0208990ca37b3b24.webm?t=1762452501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762110/extras/01e0a39958e162db0208990ca37b3b24.mp4?t=1762452501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>In depth exploration of the plot story</strong></u>: Fragmented information waiting for you to piece together the truth with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762110/extras/e6ed6e42b60847eada1dfe60136430ab.poster.avif?t=1762452501\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762110/extras/e6ed6e42b60847eada1dfe60136430ab.webm?t=1762452501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762110/extras/e6ed6e42b60847eada1dfe60136430ab.mp4?t=1762452501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Puzzles and Mechanism Systems</strong></u>: Not only do we need physical force, but we also need to use our brains to solve puzzles in order to continue delving into the core area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762110/extras/a902008efb34df21ba2735d53270961b.poster.avif?t=1762452501\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762110/extras/a902008efb34df21ba2735d53270961b.webm?t=1762452501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762110/extras/a902008efb34df21ba2735d53270961b.mp4?t=1762452501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face the secrets deep within the base?</p>",
